{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Typin 是一款主打極簡輸入與筆記體驗的寫作工具，適合開發者、作家，以及需要隨時捕捉靈感的使用者。它支援純文字與 Markdown 雙模式，並可透過區域網絡即時同步，在電腦瀏覽器繼續編輯；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-50.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>雙模式寫作與即時同步</h2>\n<p>Typin 提供純文字與 Markdown 雙模式，可一鍵切換並記住偏好，配合語法高亮、快速工具列、標題跳轉、智能列表與手勢格式化，方便快速整理內容。它亦支援區域網絡即時同步，可在電腦瀏覽器繼續編輯，並可選擇密碼驗證；另有多文件管理、自動儲存、匯出 .md 或 .txt，以及字體、行距、主題等個人化設定。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-45-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-46-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-47-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-48-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-49-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Typin – A minimal input app</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/typin-a-minimal-input-app/id6758349989?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:13.139319+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:03:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T22:58:17.737951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:44.084067+00:00","content_hash":"6164400a25bf954a3a95708077d8ada65407438c0fd60b25ecda3c2f86b257c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:13.139319+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}